# Rider-specific files that should be ignored
# The .idea folder contains project-specific settings for JetBrains IDEs like Rider.
# Some files within .idea are meant to be shared (e.g., VCS mappings, shared run configurations),
# while others are user-specific and should be ignored.
.idea/workspace.xml
.idea/tasks.xml
.idea/shelf/
.idea/dictionaries/
.idea/vcs.xml # If you prefer not to share VCS settings
.idea/modules.xml # If you prefer not to share module settings
.idea/*.iml # Module files are often user-specific
.idea/misc.xml # Can contain user-specific settings
.idea/encodings.xml # If you prefer not to share encoding settings
.idea/watcherTasks.xml # User-specific file watchers

# Files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons
_ReSharper.*/
*.resharper
